  <NAME>Homo sapiens</NAME>
  <TITLE>Expression data from colorectal cancer patients</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>The study consist of patients who presented at Memorial Sloan-Kettering Cancer Center with a colonic neoplasm between 1992 and 2004. Biological specimens used in this study include primary colon adenocarcinomas, adenomas, metastasis and corresponding normal mucosae. Overall design: 390 expression arrays</DESCRIPTION>
